# Balboa Remade's gravel adit (CIPlay balboa_remade_cave, 11-12 w13; in a test world 'CI ...'; offline-written, NOT yet run).
# Points as in its recipe (the origin frame): the knoll hw_mount at -10 42 (b 32, h 28); kit_sys mouth 1 at -2 75 (vined, yaw 180),
# mouth 2 at -18 75 (16 m on, open), trunk down to z 51 and bending to x -12, the branch off it at z 63 to the chamber at ~(6 62)
# with the rangers' chest. HEIGHT GUESSES (need a Raft surface probe): the foot/floor 6.2 m (flatten shelves), the ground over
# the chamber ~11.5 m. The offset is the old one; check it after the build (the knoll can move the land centre).
island Balboa Remade keep
offset 0.6425 -0.5063
hour 11
weather Calm

# The knoll and the two mouths from outside
picture ba_gravel_out -10 14 92 -10 9 75
picture ba_gravel_mouth -10 9 88 -18 7 75
# In by the open east... the open mouth (mouth 2), along the passage to the trunk, then the branch to the chamber
walk -18 79 to -18 75 to -18 66 to -13 54 to -8 51 to -2 53 to -2 63 to 2 63 to 6 62 below=14
picture ba_gravel_in -4 8.2 63 6 7 62 light=20
open Rangers' gravel cache
wait 2
expect item Rope 2
# Out again the way in
walk 6 62 to 2 63 to -2 63 to -2 53 to -8 51 to -13 54 to -18 66 to -18 75 to -18 79 below=14
